    "name": "SEAL",
    "description": "The text describes developing a novel $\\gamma$-decaying heuristic theory that unifies existing link prediction heuristics and proves they can be approximated using local subgraphs. Based on this theory, a new method is proposed to learn these heuristics directly from local subgraphs utilizing a graph neural network (GNN). This GNN-based approach achieves unprecedented performance across various problems.",
